<title>USA: Greyhound class action suit dismissed.</title>
<headline>Greyhound class action suit dismissed.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greyhound Lines Inc said on Monday a class action securities lawsuit filed against it and several former company officers had been dismissed.</p>
<p>A U.S. District Court granted the defendants' motion to dismiss the case, finding &quot;beyond doubt that the plaintiffs could prove no set of facts in support of their claims that would entitle them to relief,&quot; the bus company said.</p>
<p>The suit was filed in mid-1994 by six plaintiffs. The plaintiffs were given 20 days to amend their complaint, Greyhound said.</p>
